---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: 文章标签
eyebrow: TOPICS
description: 从主题进入文章，沿着概念之间的联系继续阅读。
permalink: /tags/index.html
---
<nav class="tag-cloud" aria-label="全部标签">
  {% for tag in collections.tagList %}
    <a href="#{{ tag }}"># {{ tag }} <span>{{ collections[tag].length }}</span></a>
  {% endfor %}
</nav>

<div class="tag-groups">
  {% for tag in collections.tagList %}
    <section class="tag-group" id="{{ tag }}">
      <header>
        <p class="eyebrow">TOPIC</p>
        <h2># {{ tag }}</h2>
      </header>
      <ol>
        {% for post in collections[tag] | reverse %}
          <li>
            <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
            <time datetime="{{ post.date | dateIso }}">{{ post.date | dateDisplay }}</time>
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ol>
    </section>
  {% else %}
    <p>暂无标签。</p>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
